xt><rect x=\"190.3\" y=\"230.0\" width=\"77.6\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#2a78d6\" data-tip=\"Pantanal · Establishments: 37.8%\"/><text x=\"270.9\" y=\"241.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">37.8</text><text x=\"385.0\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D3A\">Area</text><line x1=\"385.0\" x2=\"385.0\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"246\" stroke=\"#9ca3af\"/><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"23.3\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#c3c2b7\" data-tip=\"T1 · Low aggregate scale (provisional label) · Area: 11.3%\"/><text x=\"411.3\" y=\"41.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">11.3</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"54.0\" width=\"14.9\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#4a3aa7\" data-tip=\"T2 · Tenure awaiting title, unspecialised (provisional label) · Area: 7.2%\"/><text x=\"402.9\" y=\"65.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">7.2</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"78.0\" width=\"34.8\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#008300\" data-tip=\"T3 · High aggregate scale (provisional label) · Area: 16.9%\"/><text x=\"422.8\" y=\"89.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">16.9</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"102.0\" width=\"20.1\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#eda100\" data-tip=\"T4 · Mechanised with tenure awaiting title (provisional label) · Area: 9.8%\"/><text x=\"408.1\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">9.8</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"126.0\" width=\"46.2\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#e87ba4\" data-tip=\"T5 · Horticultural-irrigated (provisional label) · Area: 22.5%\"/><text x=\"434.2\" y=\"137.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">22.5</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"150.0\" width=\"26.3\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#111827\" data-tip=\"Mato Grosso · Area: 12.8%\"/><text x=\"414.3\" y=\"161.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">12.8</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"182.0\" width=\"29.7\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#1baf7a\" data-tip=\"Amazon · Area: 14.4%\"/><text x=\"417.7\" y=\"193.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">14.4</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"206.0\" width=\"14.1\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#eb6834\" data-tip=\"Cerrado · Area: 6.8%\"/><text x=\"402.1\" y=\"217.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">6.8</text><rect x=\"385.0\" y=\"230.0\" width=\"78.6\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#2a78d6\" data-tip=\"Pantanal · Area: 38.2%\"/><text x=\"466.6\" y=\"241.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">38.2</text><text x=\"579.7\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D3A\">Mean area</text><line x1=\"579.7\" x2=\"579.7\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"246\" stroke=\"#9ca3af\"/><rect x=\"579.7\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"20.6\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#c3c2b7\" data-tip=\"T1 · Low aggregate scale (provisional label) · Mean area: 10.0%\"/><text x=\"603.3\" y=\"41.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">10.0</text><rect x=\"575.9\" y=\"54.0\" width=\"3.8\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#4a3aa7\" data-tip=\"T2 · Tenure awaiting title, unspecialised (provisional label) · Mean area: −1.9%\"/><text x=\"572.9\" y=\"65.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"end\">−1.9</text><rect x=\"579.7\" y=\"78.0\" width=\"37.9\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#008300\" data-tip=\"T3 · High aggregate scale (provisional label) · Mean area: 18.4%\"/><text x=\"620.6\" y=\"89.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">18.4</text><rect x=\"579.7\" y=\"102.0\" width=\"41.2\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#eda100\" data-tip=\"T4 · Mechanised with tenure awaiting title (provisional label) · Mean area: 20.1%\"/><text x=\"623.9\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">20.1</text><rect x=\"579.1\" y=\"126.0\" width=\"0.6\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#e87ba4\" data-tip=\"T5 · Horticultural-irrigated (provisional label) · Mean area: −0.3%\"/><text x=\"576.1\" y=\"137.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"end\">−0.3</text><rect x=\"579.7\" y=\"150.0\" width=\"15.2\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#111827\" data-tip=\"Mato Grosso · Mean area: 7.4%\"/><text x=\"597.9\" y=\"161.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">7.4</text><rect x=\"579.7\" y=\"182.0\" width=\"28.4\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#1baf7a\" data-tip=\"Amazon · Mean area: 13.8%\"/><text x=\"611.0\" y=\"193.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">13.8</text><rect x=\"578.5\" y=\"206.0\" width=\"1.2\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#eb6834\" data-tip=\"Cerrado · Mean area: −0.6%\"/><text x=\"575.5\" y=\"217.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"end\">−0.6</text><rect x=\"579.7\" y=\"230.0\" width=\"0.7\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#2a78d6\" data-tip=\"Pantanal · Mean area: 0.3%\"/><text x=\"583.3\" y=\"241.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\" text-anchor=\"start\">0.3</text></svg><figcaption class=\"legenda-svg\">Note: change from 2006 to 2017, in %, calculated from the municipal sum for each group, for all agricultural establishments. T1 to T5: Manuscript 1 types (provisional labels in the table above).</figcaption></figure>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\nChange in the number, area and mean area of establishments, by type and by biome\n\n:::\n\n::: {.achado}\nAs @tbl-dinamica-tipo and @fig-dinamica show, T5 recorded the largest increase in the number of establishments (22.8%), with mean area almost unchanged (−0.3%). T4, by contrast, lost 8.6% of its establishments, while its mean area increased by 20.1%, the largest rise of any type. T3 also lost establishments (−1.3%) and gained area (16.9%).\n:::\n\nThese differences appear in the sums, but the statistical evidence for them across municipalities is not clear. @tbl-medianas-tipo complements the sums with the median municipal change. @tbl-testes-tipo indicates that none of the three measures differs between types in the Kruskal-Wallis test on municipal changes (p ≥ 0.19).\n\n::: {#tbl-medianas-tipo}\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"